  "question": {
    "text": "Let the orthocentre and centroid of a triangle be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> respectively. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is the circumcentre of this triangle, then the radius of the circle having line segment <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> as diameter, is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0012_eddcf02efa61.png\" style=\"width: 293px; height: 57px;\" /><br /><br />Centroid&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;divides the line joining Orthocentre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and circumcentre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> in the ratio&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>40</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br />Radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math>"
  }
}